  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DBP: Artlinco A/S</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The business idea is to provide Industrial Design (including packaging solutions) to the private sector companies in Tanzania (East Africa) and by doing so giving the local companies access to the fast growing retail sector as step one followed by access to export to the international markets.

The two partners Artlinco A/S and Tanzania Printers will focus on designing, producing and implementing intelligent solutions for exposure of products produced by Tanzanian (East African) companies in order for them to expand their sales in the East African / International markets.

This will improve Tanzanian (East African) private sector companies&apos; abilities to expand their sales domestically and internationally.</narrative>
  </description>
